Music Backing Track ,it can generate high quality music accompaniment easily and quickly, it is the best assistant for your music learning.

1.  Remove the vocals in the song and cover the song;
2. Remove the drum part in the music, convenient for drummers to practice, record and perform;
3. Remove the guitar part in the music, convenient for guitarist to practice, record and perform;
4、Remove the bass part in the music, convenient for the bassist to practice, recording and performance;
5、Mix and modulate vocals, drums, bass and other voices in any ratio. You can even output any individual track to help you learn to pick and learn;
6、You can also adjust the tempo of the accompaniment generated above;

Music Backing Track  APP integrates the accompaniment generation, up/down and speed change functions together to provide a one-stop service.


The software analyzes music files or music video files in depth by AI, and generates backing tracks by freely combining the volume ratio of vocals, drums, bass, piano and other parts in the music, and adjusts the backing tracks in up-regulation, down-regulation and playback speed at the same time.

The unique combination of accompaniment, up/down and speed adjustment in one package provides a one-stop service and greatly improves the operating experience.

You don't need to spend time and effort to find the backing tracks anymore.


